{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Title:</strong><br><i>Sheep vs Tigers</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Genre:</strong><br>Turn-Based Strategy Puzzle Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual-Character Rivalry System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player controls a sheep on a grid-based map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sheep must outmaneuver AI-controlled tigers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both sides take turns, with each move triggering the opponent\u2019s response.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sheep\u2019s Special Abilities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can push boxes to alter the map layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to trap all tigers by strategically positioning boxes, rendering them immobile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiger\u2019s Behavior Patterns:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">AI tigers actively track the sheep\u2019s position.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If a tiger moves adjacent to the sheep, it will devour the sheep, resulting in failure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tigers calculate the shortest path to reach the sheep.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Flow:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players select a level from the stage selection menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the sheep to move and push boxes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each sheep move, the tigers take their turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Successfully trapping all tigers leads to victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the sheep is caught, players can instantly reset the level.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Target Audience:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fans of strategic puzzle games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enthusiasts of block-pushing mechanics (e.g., <i>Sokoban</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual strategy gamers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613480?t=1745862795","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613480?t=1745862795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613480/6eb9e82c8c1be53215ae397998e9998f2b598d4d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745862795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613480/6eb9e82c8c1be53215ae397998e9998f2b598d4d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745862795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Title:</strong><br><i>Sheep vs Tigers</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Genre:</strong><br>Turn-Based Strategy Puzzle Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dual-Character Rivalry System:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player controls a sheep on a grid-based map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sheep must outmaneuver AI-controlled tigers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both sides take turns, with each move triggering the opponent\u2019s response.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sheep\u2019s Special Abilities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can push boxes to alter the map layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal is to trap all tigers by strategically positioning boxes, rendering them immobile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>T